{"id":"wb-7-1485","name":"纳家户清真寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"纳家户清真寺","text":"纳家户清真寺，位于宁夏回族自治区银川市永宁县杨和镇纳家户村，是中华人民共和国宁夏回族自治区文物保护单位之一。\n清真寺建于明朝嘉靖三年（1524年），是元代名臣赛典赤·赡思丁的纳姓后裔子孙所建。1988年，授予宁夏回族自治区文物保护单位，是一座古建筑及历史纪念建筑物。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BA%B3%E5%AE%B6%E6%88%B7%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":89812327,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89812327","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3780ea07cedf02dfeacfd3f3.jpg","title":"纳家户清真寺.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%B3%E5%AE%B6%E6%88%B7%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/%E7%BA%B3%E5%AE%B6%E6%88%B7%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​纳家户清真寺的正门","width":320,"height":237}}